e Canyons is sharing still going strong\",\"breadcrumb\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/visitsouthernutah.com\\/events\\/symphony-of-the-canyons-christmas-festival-concert\\/#breadcrumb\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"potentialAction\":[{\"@type\":\"ReadAction\",\"target\":[\"https:\\/\\/visitsouthernutah.com\\/events\\/symphony-of-the-canyons-christmas-festival-concert\\/\"]}]},{\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/visitsouthernutah.com\\/events\\/symphony-of-the-canyons-christmas-festival-concert\\/#breadcrumb\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https:\\/\\/visitsouthernutah.com\\/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Events\",\"item\":\"https:\\/\\/visitsouthernutah.com\\/events\\/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Symphony of the Canyons Christmas Festival\"}]}]}},\"acf\":{\"additional_heading\":\"\",\"location_name\":\"Kanab Middle School\",\"address\":\"690 S Cowboy Way, Kanab, UT\",\"contact_number\":\" (435) 644-3098\",\"start_datetime\":\"December 2, 2023 9:30 am\",\"multi_day_event\":false,\"end_date\":\"December 7, 2019 17:00:00\",\"recurrance\":\"\",\"category\":{\"term_id\":18,\"name\":\"Live Music &amp; Entertainment\",\"slug\":\"live-music-entertainment\",\"term_group\":0,\"term_taxonomy_id\":18,\"taxonomy\":\"event_categories\",\"description\":\"#FE0000\",\"parent\":0,\"count\":0,\"filter\":\"raw\"},\"redirect_url\":\"https:\\/\\/symphonyofthecanyons.org\",\"document_download\":false,\"information_block\":\"<p>Enjoy our annual Christmas Festival at Kanab Middle School with vendors, food, and Santa Claus.<br \\/>\\n\\u200bAll proceeds go to support the Symphony of the Canyons operations and scholarship fund.<br \\/>\\nTickets at the door: $2 each<br \\/>\\nFor vendor application and information please email\\u00a0<a href=\\\"mailto:vendor@symphonyofthecanyons.org\\\">vendor@symphonyofthecanyons.org<\\/a>.<\\/p>\\n\",\"information_heading\":\"\",\"information_block_1\":\"Thirty-five years ago, a pharmacist named Kortney Stirland decided to put together a group of musicians to perform in the town of Kanab, Utah. Some 300 concerts later, and under the same leadership, Symphony of the Canyons is sharing still going strong!<br \\/>\\r\\nFor a little orchestra in a small town, Symphony of the Canyons has a rich array of programs that serve not only youth and adults who live in Southern Utah and Northern Arizona, but also visitors to this beautiful region of the United States. Through performances and music classes and lessons, we bring music into the hearts of people, inspire creativity, and enrich our community.Full Orchstra consisting of 40-50 talented musicians from the around Kanab, Utah perfroming 8-10 concerts per year.<br \\/>\\r\\n\",\"gallery\":[{\"ID\":3080,\"id\":3080,\"title\":\"Symphony-of-the-Canyons-Christmas-Festival\",\"filename\":\"Symphony-of-the-Canyons-Christmas-Festival.jpg\",\"filesize\":86037,\"url\":\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/10\\/Symphony-of-the-Canyons-Christmas-Festival.jpg\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/visitsouthernutah.com\\/events\\/symphony-of-the-canyons-christmas-festival-concert\\/symphony-of-the-canyons-christmas-festival\\/\",\"alt\":\"\",\"author\":\"8\",\"description\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"name\":\"symphony-of-the-canyons-christmas-festival\",\"status\":\"inherit\",\"uploaded_to\":2228,\"date\":\"2019-12-04 22:06:26\",\"modified\":\"2019-12-04 22:06:26\",\"menu_order\":0,\"mime_type\":\"image\\/jpeg\",\"type\":\"image\",\"subtype\":\"jpeg\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/visitsouthernutah.com\\/wp-includes\\/images\\/media\\/default.png\",\"width\":720,\"height\":480,\"sizes\":{\"thumbnail\":\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/10\\/Symphony-of-the-Canyons-Christmas-Festival-150x150.jpg\",\"thumbnail-width\":150,\"thumbnail-height\":150,\"medium\":\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/10\\/Symphony-of-the-Canyons-Christmas-Festival-300x200.jpg\",\"medium-width\":300,\"medium-height\":200,\"medi