\\/wp\\/v2\\/users\\/8\"}],\"wp:featuredmedia\":[{\"embeddable\":true,\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/visitsouthernutah.com\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/media\\/15116\"}],\"wp:attachment\":[{\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/visitsouthernutah.com\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/media?parent=1804\"}],\"wp:term\":[{\"taxonomy\":\"event_categories\",\"embeddable\":true,\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/visitsouthernutah.com\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/event_categories?post=1804\"}],\"curies\":[{\"name\":\"wp\",\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/api.w.org\\/{rel}\",\"templated\":true}]}}',1,'2023-10-05 04:52:01','2023-10-06 22:56:14'),(60,'K-Town Turkey Trot 5K','vsu','1799',166,'Thanksgiving: Thursday, November 23, 2023\n\nStart your Thanksgiving morning with the K-Town Turkey Trot 5K fun run. Meet us out at Jackson Flat Reservoir 2 miles South of Kanab. The Turkey Trot will take place on the Sherry Belle Trail that encompasses 3 miles of beautiful Jackson Flat Reservoir.\nThe race begins at 8:30am.  Day of registration is at 7:30am. Dress up in your favorite Thanksgiving flare! What better way to start your Thanksgiving than with a 5K fun run before eating your delicious Thanksgiving feast!?!\nEarly registration pricing:\n$5/individual\n$20/family*\nRegister before November 23rd to take advantage of early pricing\nPrice increases on November 23rd to the following:\n$10/individual\n$40/family*\n*Family Pricing is for immediate family members only and is limited to 6 per group. (mom, dad and children, etc&#8230;, or family members living under the same roof) Extended family members are not included in the Family Pricing.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-11-23 07:30:00',NULL,'{\"id\":1799,\"date\":\"2019-09-29T20:04:43\",\"date_gmt\":\"2019-09-29T20:04:43\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"http:\\/\\/kanecounty.fluidstaging.com\\/?post_type=events&#038;p=1799\"},\"modified\":\"2023-04-03T15:36:32\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2023-04-03T21:36:32\",\"slug\":\"k-town-turkey-trot-5k\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"events\",\"link\":\"https:\\