ale Harvest Festival\"}]},{\"@type\":\"WebSite\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/visitsouthernutah.com\\/#website\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/visitsouthernutah.com\\/\",\"name\":\"Visit Southern Utah\",\"description\":\"Kanab - Magically Unspoiled\",\"potentialAction\":[{\"@type\":\"SearchAction\",\"target\":{\"@type\":\"EntryPoint\",\"urlTemplate\":\"https:\\/\\/visitsouthernutah.com\\/search\\/{search_term_string}\"},\"query-input\":\"required name=search_term_string\"}],\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"}]}},\"featured_image_url\":\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/07\\/glendale-apples-768x638.jpg\",\"_links\":{\"self\":[{\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/visitsouthernutah.com\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/events\\/1768\"}],\"collection\":[{\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/visitsouthernutah.com\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/events\"}],\"about\":[{\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/visitsouthernutah.com\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/types\\/events\"}],\"author\":[{\"embeddable\":true,\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/visitsouthernutah.com\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/users\\/8\"}],\"wp:featuredmedia\":[{\"embeddable\":true,\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/visitsouthernutah.com\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/media\\/2974\"}],\"wp:attachment\":[{\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/visitsouthernutah.com\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/media?parent=1768\"}],\"wp:term\":[{\"taxonomy\":\"event_categories\",\"embeddable\":true,\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/visitsouthernutah.com\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/event_categories?post=1768\"}],\"curies\":[{\"name\":\"wp\",\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/api.w.org\\/{rel}\",\"templated\":true}]}}',1,'2023-10-05 04:52:01','2025-03-21 18:21:45'),(66,'Grand Circle Trailfest','vsu','1757',221,'Trailfest is a 3-day/4-night trail running festival in the heart of North America&#8217;s most scenic national parks: Bryce Canyon, Zion, &amp; Horseshoe Bend.\n\n\nWhether you&#8217;re a hardcore ultramarathon runner or just getting into trail running, or maybe you&#8217;re just a supportive spouse (bring the whole family) or friend who doesn&#8217;t run, the Grand Circle Trailfest has something for you!\nEach day, we&#8217;ll run a segment of trail highlighting the natural landscape unique to that particular area. Each race is timed and you&#8217;ll receive a cumulative time at the end of the festival on Saturday. Top finishers for each course will be crowned at Trailfest Headquarters in Kanab, Utah at the end of each day.\nRegistration includes full participation in all three races, full Festival access, an on-site camping spot with a tent (yes, you&#8217;re welcome to bring your own tent if you prefer), and meal tickets for breakfast and dinner Thurs–Sat. (Additional meal tickets can be purchased on-site.) Festival activities are free for your non-running family and friends.\nBasic Itinerary\nWednesday  &#8211; Check-in begins at noon\nThursday  &#8211;\nFriday  &#8211;\nSaturday  &#8211;\nSunday  &#8211; Check-out by noon\nFollow us on Facebook or visit Grand Circle Trailfest to learn more or sign up.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-01 12:00:00','2025-10-05 17:00:00','{\"id\":1757,\"date\":\"2019-09-29T19:07:44\",\"date_gmt\":\"2019-09-29T19:07:44\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"http:\\/\\/kanecounty.fluidstaging.com\\/?post_type=events&#038;p=1757\"},\"modified\":\"2025-03-20T14:59:21\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2025-03-20T20:59:21\",\"slug\":\"grand-circle-trailfest\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"events\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/visitsouthernutah.com\\/events\\/grand-circle-trailfest\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"Grand Circle Trailfest\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>Trailfest is a 3-day\\/4-night trail running festival in the heart of North America&#8217;s most scenic national parks: Bryce Canyon, Zion, &amp; Horseshoe Bend.<br \\/>\\nWhether you&#8217;re a hardcore ultramarathon runner or just getting into trail running, or maybe you&#8217;re just a supportive spouse (bring the whole family) or a friend who doesn&#8217;t run, the Grand Circle Trailfest has something for you!<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"<p>Trailfest is a 3-day\\/4-night trail running festival in the heart of North America&#8217;s most scenic national parks: Bryce Canyon, Zion, &hellip;<\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":8,\"featured_media\":3112,\"template\":\"\",\"event_categories\":[],\"class_list\":[\"post-1757\",\"events\",\"type-events\",\"status-publish\",\"has-post-thumbnail\",\"hentry\"],\"acf\":{\"additional_heading\":\"Grand Circle Trailfest\",\"location_name\":\"Jacob Hamblin Park\",\"address\":\"566 N 100 E, Kanab, UT 84741\",\"contact_number\":\"\",\"start_datetime\":\"October 1, 2025 12:00 pm\",\"multi_day_event\":true,\"category\":{\"term_id\":11,\"name\":\"Parks &amp; Outdoor\",\"slug\":\"parks-outdoor\",\"term_group\":0,\"term_taxonomy_id\":11,\"taxonomy\":\"event_categories\",\"description\":\"#00FE3B\",\"parent\":0,\"count\":0,\"filter\":\"raw\"},\"redirect_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.vacationraces.com\\/trailfest\\/kanab\\/\",\"information_block\":\"<div class=\\\"kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql ii04i59q\\\">\\n<div dir=\\\"auto\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"nc684nl6\\\">Trailfest is a 3-day\\/4-night trail running festival in the heart of North America&#8217;s most scenic national parks: Bryce Canyon, Zion, &amp; Horseshoe Bend.<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<h5>Whether you&#8217;re a hardcore ultramarathon runner or just getting into trail running, or maybe you&#8217;re just a supportive spouse (bring the whole family) or friend who doesn&#8217;t run, the Grand Circle Trailfest has something for you!<\\/h5>\\n<p>Each day, we&#8217;ll run a segment of trail highlighting the natural landscape unique to that particular area. Each race is timed and you&#8217;ll receive a cumulative time at the end of the festival on Saturday. Top finishers for each course will be crowned at Trailfest Headquarters in Kanab, Utah at the end of each day.<\\/p>\\n<p>Registration includes full participation in all three races, full Festival access, an on-site camping spot with a tent (yes, you&#8217;re welcome to bring your own tent if you prefer), and meal tickets for breakfast and dinner Thurs\\u2013Sat. (Additional meal tickets can be purchased on-site.) Festival activities are free for your non-running family and friends.<\\/p>\\n<h4>Basic Itinerary<\\/h4>\\n<p><strong>Wednesday <\\/strong>\\u00a0&#8211; Check-in begins at noon<br \\/>\\n<strong>Thursday <\\/strong>\\u00a0&#8211;<br \\/>\\n<strong>Friday <\\/strong>\\u00a0&#8211;<br \\/>\\n<strong>Saturday <\\/strong>\\u00a0&#8211;<br \\/>\\n<strong>Sunday <\\/strong>\\u00a0&#8211; Check-out by noon<\\/p>\\n<p>Follow us on <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/thetrailfest\\\">Facebook<\\/a> or visit <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.vacationraces.com\\/trailfest\\/kanab\\/\\\">Grand Circle Trailfest<\\/a> to learn more or sign up.<\\/p>\\n\",\"information_heading\":\"\",\"information_block_1\":\"\",\"gallery\":[{\"ID\":3112,\"id\":3112,\"title\":\"Trailfest-1-1\",\"filename\":\"Trailfest-1-1.jpg\",\"filesize\":108192,\"url\":\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/09\\/Trailfest-1-1.jpg\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/visitsouthernutah.com\\/events\\/grand-circle-trailfest\\/trailfest-1-1\\/\",\"alt\":\"\",\"author\":\"8\",\"description\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"name\":\"trailfest-1-1\",\"status\":\"inherit\",\"uploaded_to\":1757,\"date\":\"2019-12-05 00:36:33\",\"modified\":\"2019-12-05 00:36:33\",\"menu_order\":0,\"mime_type\":\"image\\/jpeg\",\"type\":\"image\",\"subtype\":\"jpeg\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/visitsouthernutah.com\\/wp-includes\\/images\\/media\\/default.png\",\"width\":960,\"height\":640,\"sizes\":{\"thumbnail\":\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/09\\/Trailfest-1-1-150x150.jpg\",\"thumbnail-width\":150,\"thumbnail-height\":150,\"medium\":\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/09\\/Trailfest-1-1-300x200.jpg\",\"medium-width\":300,\"medium-height\":200,\"medium_large\":\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2019\\/09\\/Trailfest-1-1-768x512.jpg\",\"medium_large-width\":768,\"medium_large-height\":512,\"large\":\"\\/wp-conten