2023-10-06 22:54:42'),(73,'Rocky Mountain Pro Rodeo Assoc. Finals','vsu','4983',161,'Kanab Rocky Mountain Pro Rodeo Association Finals Rodeo\n\nKanab, Utah will be hosting the Rocky Mountain Pro Rodeo Association Finals Rodeo November 10 &amp; 11, 2023!\nHome of the RMPRA Finals 2020-2025 will be host to world-class rodeo athletes!\nWatch many tough cowboys &amp; cowgirls compete in Bull Riding, Bareback Broncs, Saddle Bronc, Barrel Racing, Team Roping, Breakaway, Bull Dogging and much more! Tickets are $10 per person, buy online or at the gate!\nRodeo starts at 6pm on Nov 10th &amp; 3pm on Nov 11th at the Kaneplex Arena.\nDon&#8217;t miss out on this wild good time!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-11-10 18:00:00','2023-11-11 17:00:00','{\"id\":4983,\"date\":\"2020-10-01T23:39:36\",\"date_gmt\":\"2020-10-01T23:39:36\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/visitsouthernutah.com\\/?post_type=events&#038;p=4983\"},\"modified\":\"2023-10-05T09:50:16\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2023-10-05T15:50:16\",\"slug\":\"rocky-mountain-pro-rodeo-assoc-finals\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"events\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/visitsouthernutah.com\\/events\\/rocky-mountain-pro-rodeo-assoc-finals\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"Rocky Mountain Pro Rodeo Assoc. Finals\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":8,\"featured_media\":4944,\"template\":\"\",\"event_categories\":[],\"yoast_head\":\"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v18.6 - https:\\/\\/yoast.com\\/wordpress\\/plugins\\/seo\\/ -->\\n<title>Rocky Mountain Pro Rodeo Assoc. Finals | Visit Southern Utah<\\/title>\\n<meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Kanab, Utah will be hosting the Rocky Mountain Pro Rodeo Association Finals Rodeo November 12 &amp; 13, 2021! Home of the RMPRA Finals 2020-2025 for world-class rodeo athletes\\\" \\/>\\n<meta name=\\\"robots\\\" content=\\\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, ma