 your life.  Your hopes, dreams and visions! Come discover your UNIQUE self!\n\nJoin us Saturday, March 29 from 9:00am to 3:00pm at the Kanab Library. The event is free and we will provide you with a boxed lunch! We look forward to seeing you there!\n\nCall or text Stacey Rhoades to save your spot or for more information! (435) 899-0363.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-03-29 09:00:00',NULL,'{\"id\":21182,\"date\":\"2025-03-19T15:06:28\",\"date_gmt\":\"2025-03-19T21:06:28\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/visitsouthernutah.com\\/?post_type=events&#038;p=21182\"},\"modified\":\"2025-03-19T15:06:28\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2025-03-19T21:06:28\",\"slug\":\"tree-of-life-workshop\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"events\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/visitsouthernutah.com\\/events\\/tree-of-life-workshop\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"Tree of Life Workshop\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":8,\"featured_media\":21184,\"template\":\"\",\"event_categories\":[],\"class_list\":[\"post-21182\",\"events\",\"type-events\",\"status-publish\",\"has-post-thumbnail\",\"hentry\"],\"acf\":{\"additional_heading\":\"\",\"location_name\":\"Kanab City Library\",\"address\":\"\",\"contact_number\":\"\",\"start_datetime\":\"March 29, 2025 9:00 am\",\"multi_day_event\":false,\"recurrance\":\"\",\"category\":{\"term_id\":14,\"name\":\"General Community Events\",\"slug\":\"general-community-events\",\"term_group\":0,\"term_taxonomy_id\":14,\"taxonomy\":\"event_categories\",\"description\":\"#EACF00\",\"parent\":0,\"count\":0,\"filter\":\"raw\"},\"redirect_url\":\"\",\"document_download\":false,\"information_block\":\"<div dir=\\\"auto\\\">Ladies of Kanab! Roxanne Leonard and Stacey Rhoades will be presenting a FREE workshop called the Tree of Life! It is an interactive workshop where we will look at your life through the metaphor of a tree! Your roots and heritage and how it has shaped you. Your gifts and