ors – Savor delicious eats while you take in the action.Family-Friendly Atmosphere – A perfect event for rodeo fans of all ages.\nMark your calendars and join us in Kanab for an unforgettable weekend celebrating the spirit of the Wild West!\nTickets\n&nbsp;\n\n&nbsp;',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-05-30 19:00:00','2025-05-31 17:00:00','{\"id\":18192,\"date\":\"2024-06-10T16:00:26\",\"date_gmt\":\"2024-06-10T22:00:26\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/visitsouthernutah.com\\/?post_type=events&#038;p=18192\"},\"modified\":\"2025-03-13T14:33:40\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2025-03-13T20:33:40\",\"slug\":\"prca-rodeo\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"events\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/visitsouthernutah.com\\/events\\/prca-rodeo\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"PRCA Rodeo\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":8,\"featured_media\":18199,\"template\":\"\",\"event_categories\":[],\"class_list\":[\"post-18192\",\"events\",\"type-events\",\"status-publish\",\"has-post-thumbnail\",\"hentry\"],\"acf\":{\"additional_heading\":\"\",\"location_name\":\"Kaneplex Arena\",\"address\":\"\",\"contact_number\":\"\",\"start_datetime\":\"May 30, 2025 7:00 pm\",\"multi_day_event\":true,\"end_date\":\"May 31, 2025 17:00:00\",\"recurrance\":\"\",\"category\":{\"term_id\":12,\"name\":\"Sports &amp; Recreation\",\"slug\":\"sports-recreation\",\"term_group\":0,\"term_taxonomy_id\":12,\"taxonomy\":\"event_categories\",\"description\":\"#FE00F4\",\"parent\":0,\"count\":0,\"filter\":\"raw\"},\"redirect_url\":\"https:\\/\\/myclicktickets.com\\/productlists\\/7NTDAGDC4SH81\",\"document_download\":false,\"information_block\":\"<p data-start=\\\"159\\\" data-end=\\\"481\\\">Get ready for two action-packed nights at the Kanab PRCA Rodeo, happening May 30-31, 2025, at the Kaneplex Arena in Kanab, Utah! This annual rodeo, sanctioned by the Professional Rodeo Cowboys Association (PRCA), showcases top-tier talent as skilled cowboys and cowgirls compete in heart-pounding events.<\\/p>\\n<p data-start=\\\"483\\\" data-end=\\\"759\\\">Produced by Honeycutt Rodeo Company, a name synonymous with high-quality rodeo experiences, this event brings the best in bull riding, barrel racing, bronc riding, steer wrestling, and more. Feel the excitement as competitors go head-to-head in classic rodeo action!<\\/p>\\n<p data-start=\\\"761\\\" data-end=\\\"1012\\\">Enjoy More Than Just the Rodeo!<\\/p>\\n<p data-start=\\\"761\\\" data-end=\\\"1012\\\">Beer Garden \\u2013 Cool off with a refreshing drink.<br data-start=\\\"853\\\" data-end=\\\"856\\\" \\/>Food Vendors \\u2013 Savor delicious eats while you take in the action.<br data-start=\\\"928\\\" data-end=\\\"931\\\" \\/>Family-Friendly Atmosphere \\u2013 A perfect event for rodeo fans of all ages.<\\/p>\\n<p data-start=\\\"1014\\\" data-end=\\\"1130\\\">Mark your calendars and join us in Kanab for an unforgettable weekend celebrating the spirit of the Wild West!<\\/p>\\n<p><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/myclicktickets.com\\/productlists\\/7NTDAGDC4SH81\\\">Tickets<\\/a><\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"alignnone wp-image-21092 size-full\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/visitsouthernutah.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/06\\/Copy-of-rodeo-1-scaled.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"2560\\\" height=\\\"1709\\\" srcset=\\\"\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/06\\/Copy-of-rodeo-1-scaled.jpg 2560w, \\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/06\\/Copy-of-rodeo-1-300x200.jpg 300w, \\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/06\\/Copy-of-rodeo-1-1024x684.jpg 1024w, \\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/06\\/Copy-of-rodeo-1-768x513.jpg 768w, \\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/06\\/Copy-of-rodeo-1-1536x1025.jpg 1536w, \\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/06\\/Copy-of-rodeo-1-2048x1367.jpg 2048w\\\" sizes=\\\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\",\"information_heading\":\"\",\"information_block_1\":\"\",\"gallery\":false