tival for all ages connecting people to nature and to the stunning beauty of southern Utah and northern Arizona. Enjoy arts, culture, documentary film, live entertainment, presentations and guided outdoor adventures amidst some of the world’s most beautiful scenery.\nAmazing Earthfest inspires and educates people to value stewardship of natural and cultural resources on America’s public lands, and to explore responsibility to present and future generations.\nAll events are free unless noted otherwise, and donations are greatly appreciated. We suggest a $20 donation when you register, to help support our mission and make this annual festival possible.\nMeet new friends. Learn more about places you love. Get involved. Make a difference.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-05-08 10:00:00','2025-05-11 17:00:00','{\"id\":3665,\"date\":\"2020-02-25T22:46:30\",\"date_gmt\":\"2020-02-25T22:46:30\",\"guid\":{\"rendered\":\"https:\\/\\/visitsouthernutah.com\\/?post_type=events&#038;p=3665\"},\"modified\":\"2025-03-13T13:48:48\",\"modified_gmt\":\"2025-03-13T19:48:48\",\"slug\":\"amazing-earthfest\",\"status\":\"publish\",\"type\":\"events\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/visitsouthernutah.com\\/events\\/amazing-earthfest\\/\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"Amazing Earthfest\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"\",\"protected\":false},\"excerpt\":{\"rendered\":\"\",\"protected\":false},\"author\":8,\"featured_media\":3666,\"template\":\"\",\"event_categories\":[],\"class_list\":[\"post-3665\",\"events\",\"type-events\",\"status-publish\",\"has-post-thumbnail\",\"hentry\"],\"acf\":{\"additional_heading\":\"Welcome to Southern Utah\'s premiere Festival of Experiential Learning, Discovery, Arts and Adventure!\",\"location_name\":\"Kanab\",\"address\":\"\",\"contact_number\":\"\",\"start_datetime\":\"May 8, 2025 10:00 am\",\"multi_day_event\":true,\"end_date\":\"May 11, 2025 17:00:00\",\"recurrance\":\"\",\"category\":{\"term_id\":11,\"name\":\"Parks &amp; Outdoor\",\"slug\":\"parks-outdoor\",\"term_group\":0,\"term_taxonomy_id\":11,\"taxonomy\":\"event_categories\",\"description\":\"#00FE3B\",\"parent\":0,\"count\":0,\"filter\":\"raw\"},\"redirect_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.amazingearthfest.org\\/sign_up\",\"document_download\":false,\"information_block\":\"<h2>Annual Amazing Earthfest<\\/h2>\\n<p>Enhance your connection to Mother Earth. 19th annual 2025 festival dates are Thursday, May 8th through Sun. May 11th.<\\/p>\\n<p>We organize a thought-provoking, informative, mission-driven, multi-day educational festival for all ages connecting people to nature and to the stunning beauty of southern Utah and northern Arizona. Enjoy arts, culture, documentary film, live entertainment, presentations and guided outdoor adventures amidst some of the world\\u2019s most beautiful scenery.<\\/p>\\n<p>Amazing Earthfest inspires and educates people to value stewardship of natural and cultural resources on America\\u2019s public lands, and to explore responsibility to present and future generations.<\\/p>\\n<p>All events are free unless noted otherwise, and donations are greatly appreciated. We suggest a $20 donation when you register, to help support our mission and make this annual festival possible.<\\/p>\\n<p>Meet new friends. Learn more about places you love. Get involved. Make a difference.<\\/p>\\n\",\"information_heading\":\"\",\"information_block_1\":\"\",\"gallery\":false,\"information_block_2\":\"\",\"related_events\":\"\"},\"yoast_head\":\"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v23.1 - https:\\/\\/yoast.com\\/wordpress\\/plugins\\/seo\\/ -->\\n<title>Kanab&#039;s 14th Annual Amazing Earthfest | Visit Southern Utah<\\/title>\\n<meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Welcome to Southern Utah&#039;s premiere Festival of Experiential Learning, Discovery, Arts and Adventure! Downtown KanabMay 10, 2020 10:00 am\\\" \\/>\\n<meta name=\\\"robots\\\" content=\\\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\\\" \\/>\\n<l